{
  "id": "the-simpsons---6x01---bart-of-darkness",
  "title": "The Simpsons - 6x01 - Bart of Darkness",
  "sourceFilename": "The Simpsons - 6x01 - Bart of Darkness.en.srt",
  "importedAt": "2026-09-19T20:05:58.634Z",
  "lineCount": 243,
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Bart of Darkness",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 2570,
      "endMs": 3938
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Well, you're certainly doing your job today, Mr. Sun.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 33405,
      "endMs": 36575
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Oh, rats.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 38377,
      "endMs": 40079
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "And here we have the world-famous Beatles...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 42481,
      "endMs": 44417
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "...exactly as they looked performing on The Ed Sullivan Show.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 44584,
      "endMs": 47954
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "I hardly think it's fair to be charged full price.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 49256,
      "endMs": 51558
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "I'm up to my knees in the original cast of M* A * S *H.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 51725,
      "endMs": 54595
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Homer, my hat goes off to you. It's cool in here, boy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 64807,
      "endMs": 69579
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "For the rest of the summer, we can live inside the refrigerator.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 69779,
      "endMs": 73383
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Homer, the fridge wasn't meant to be used this way.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 74585,
      "endMs": 77288
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "Although I must say, it's certainly refreshing.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 77755,
      "endMs": 81359
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "I got the idea when I noticed the refrigerator was cold.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 87599,
      "endMs": 90369
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "Won't this overload the motor?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 90803,
      "endMs": 92638
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "Marge, can you set the oven to cold?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 97878,
      "endMs": 100080
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "Ice cream! Ice cream!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 111693,
      "endMs": 115064
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "I'm all out of ice cream! It's true, you know. Ice cream! Ice cream!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 118201,
      "endMs": 123073
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "Fresh out of ice cream!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 123440,
      "endMs": 124812
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "Face it, Bart. Our salvation isn't gonna roll by on the back of some stupid truck.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 124826,
      "endMs": 129698
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "I gotta replace that window.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 134904,
      "endMs": 136406
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "Pool-mobile? Pool-mobile?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 136639,
      "endMs": 138174
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "Look, Lis, I snatched five bathing suits. All Martin's.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 144615,
      "endMs": 147986
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "Take your best shot. I'm wearing 17 layers.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 148186,
      "endMs": 151189
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "I brought this on myself.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 155561,
      "endMs": 157463
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "Okay, little dudes, time's up. Everybody out!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 158264,
      "endMs": 162135
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "Time's up? So long, Lis.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 165605,
      "endMs": 167341
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "I'm gonna stow away underwater and go where the pool goes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 167508,
      "endMs": 170177
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "Have a good life.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 170344,
      "endMs": 171813
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "Sorry, Bart, dude. We gotta fill this thing with Epsom salts...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 176885,
      "endMs": 179755
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "...and jam over to the old folks' home. - Oh, well. Same time tomorrow, Otto?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 179922,
      "endMs": 183826
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "No way, man. One day of summer's all we're budgeted for.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 184193,
      "endMs": 187897
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "I guess it is kind of a tease.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 188231,
      "endMs": 190701
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "Dad?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 193938,
      "endMs": 195339
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "Dad?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 196240,
      "endMs": 197575
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "Dad! Yes, Lisa?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 198977,
      "endMs": 200879
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "Dad, as you know, we've been swimming.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 201079,
      "endMs": 202981
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "And we've developed a taste for it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 203181,
      "endMs": 204783
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "We both agree that getting our own pool is the only way to go.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 204983,
      "endMs": 207887
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "Now, before you respond, understand that your refusal...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 208120,
      "endMs": 210757
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "...would result in months and months of:",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 210924,
      "endMs": 212826
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "Can we have a pool, Dad? Can we have a pool, Dad?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 212993,
      "endMs": 215562
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "Can we have a pool, Dad? Can we have a pool, Dad?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 215696,
      "endMs": 218065
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "I understand.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 218632,
      "endMs": 219900
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "Let us celebrate our new arrangement with the adding of chocolate to milk.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 220801,
      "endMs": 224939
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "Over here we have the Hick Tub, the Insta-Rust.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 229278,
      "endMs": 232181
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "That's the Lightning Magnet.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 232348,
      "endMs": 233816
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "That's the Tinkler. The Tinkler.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 234083,
      "endMs": 236219
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "I like the sound of that. We'll take it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 236386,
      "endMs": 238455
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "Is it true we should wait at least an hour after eating before we go in?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 238655,
      "endMs": 242025
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "Look, question lady, this job is not what I really do, okay? I play keyboards.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 242226,
      "endMs": 245930
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "All right, everybody in the pool!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 260747,
      "endMs": 263617
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "'Tis a fine barn, but sure 'tis no pool, English.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 263917,
      "endMs": 266987
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "Is it a pool yet? Yes, Dad.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 269223,
      "endMs": 271225
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "Who could that be?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 273027,
      "endMs": 274128
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "Hello, Mrs. Bart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 276298,
      "endMs": 278901
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "Is your pool ready yet?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 279501,
      "endMs": 280869
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "Bart, are all these children friends of yours?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 286309,
      "endMs": 290280
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "Friends and well-wishers, yes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 290414,
      "endMs": 292516
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "Hey, Bart. Hi, Bart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 292716,
      "endMs": 293984
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "Hey, my buddy, Bart. Hello, Mrs. Converdale.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 294151,
      "endMs": 296821
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "People! People, it's time we all discussed the pool-safety rules.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 301960,
      "endMs": 305698
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "Jump, Bart, jump!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 305898,
      "endMs": 307333
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "Jump, Bart, jump!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 307700,
      "endMs": 309602
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "You got it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 309836,
      "endMs": 311137
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "Hey, Bart! Your epidermis is showing!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 311504,
      "endMs": 314775
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "It is?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 314941,
      "endMs": 316210
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "See, epidermis means your hair.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 320815,
      "endMs": 323518
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "So technically it's true. That's what makes it so funny.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 325453,
      "endMs": 328790
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "Pardon me a moment.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 329124,
      "endMs": 330859
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "Hey, Nelson. He's really hurt. I think he broke his leg.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 332495,
      "endMs": 336633
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "I said: I'm sorry, that leg's gonna have to come off.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 336800,
      "endMs": 341492
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "Did I say leg? I meant that wet bathing suit.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 343561,
      "endMs": 346999
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "I'm afraid you'll need a cast on that broken bone.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 347199,
      "endMs": 350202
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "I'm gonna miss the whole summer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 351304,
      "endMs": 353039
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "Don't worry, boy. When you get a job like me, you'll miss every summer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 353206,
      "endMs": 357611
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "Isn't it amazing, the same day you got a pool...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 357978,
      "endMs": 360280
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "...is the same day we realized we liked you?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 360447,
      "endMs": 362516
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "The timing worked out great, don't you think?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 362717,
      "endMs": 364852
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "Hi. Hey, guys! Sign my cast?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 365720,
      "endMs": 368256
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "Sign my cast? Guys?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 368423,
      "endMs": 370926
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "Milhouse! Hi, Bart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 373329,
      "endMs": 376332
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "Faithful Milhouse. You'll spend the long, hot days by my side, won't you?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 376699,
      "endMs": 381838
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "I think I lost my glasses in your pool. I better go in and find them.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 382038,
      "endMs": 385976
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "But you're wearing your glasses. No, I'm not.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 386143,
      "endMs": 389413
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "Oh, look. Bart's all alone.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 391382,
      "endMs": 392951
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "Maybe I should keep him company, at least for a little while.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 393318,
      "endMs": 395253
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "Hey, come watch this. Lisa! Hey, look.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 397322,
      "endMs": 399124
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "Coming!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 405565,
      "endMs": 407300
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "Well, it looks like it's just you and me, Barty boy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 409403,
      "endMs": 412573
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "Great. I get to spend the summer with my brain.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 412940,
      "endMs": 416244
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "What fun can you have in a pool anyway that you can't have in a bathtub...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 416644,
      "endMs": 420148
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "...with a garbage bag taped around your cast?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 420315,
      "endMs": 422684
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "Traitors! Go on and have your pool! I'm fine by myself right here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 462463,
      "endMs": 467769
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "You know, this isn't so bad.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 522664,
      "endMs": 524600
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "I'll just spend the summer getting better acquainted...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 524800,
      "endMs": 527370
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "...with an old friend called television.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 527537,
      "endMs": 530240
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "Hope you enjoyed that, kids, because Krusty's out of here for the summer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 533744,
      "endMs": 537681
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "In the meantime, we'll be running...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 537882,
      "endMs": 540251
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "...classic Krusty. Enjoy!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 541052,
      "endMs": 544689
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "Good evening. Tonight my guest is AFL-CIO Chairman George Meany...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 548794,
      "endMs": 553399
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "...who will be discussing collective-bargaining agreements.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 553600,
      "endMs": 556336
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "It's a pleasure to be here, Krusty. Let me be blunt.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 556536,
      "endMs": 559172
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "Is there a labor crisis in America today?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 559373,
      "endMs": 562076
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "Well, that depends what you mean by crisis.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 562243,
      "endMs": 564312
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "There's nothing like rising with the sun...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 567215,
      "endMs": 569551
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "...for a quiet, peaceful dip in your very own pool.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 569718,
      "endMs": 573555
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "Lisa, the blob has got me! Don't touch me or it'll get you too!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 582199,
      "endMs": 585469
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "Dad, you have to put chlorine in the water every day to keep it clean.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 585636,
      "endMs": 589874
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "Chlorine, eh?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 590074,
      "endMs": 591843
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "My face is on fire!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 595080,
      "endMs": 597216
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "Oh, look. There's Bart. Wave to him.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 598884,
      "endMs": 601754
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "Maybe we should spend more time with Bart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 604657,
      "endMs": 606893
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "He's becoming isolated and weird.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 607093,
      "endMs": 609696
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "\"I swear I don't know where the bombs are! Only the miners know that!\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 609997,
      "endMs": 614402
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "\"Maybe this will loosen your tongue.\" \"No!\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 614635,
      "endMs": 618607
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "Bart? Don't turn on that light!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 619941,
      "endMs": 621610
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "Sorry, I just came to see how you were feeling.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 621810,
      "endMs": 624013
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "I'm fine, just fine. What are you writing here, a play?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 624180,
      "endMs": 626883
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "No. \"Cast of characters: Viceroy Fizzlebottom, a hearty cherub of a man...\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 627817,
      "endMs": 633156
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "Give me that! It's a work in progress.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 633323,
      "endMs": 635492
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "So.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 637061,
      "endMs": 638362
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "How do you like being Miss Popularity?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 638562,
      "endMs": 640298
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "Oh, well, you know, it ain't so great.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 640531,
      "endMs": 643268
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "Bart, it's the best thing that ever happened to me in my whole life!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 644636,
      "endMs": 647840
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "Well, anyway, I brought you a present. Look, it's the telescope I won...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 648007,
      "endMs": 651377
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "...at the Optics Festival.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 651544,
      "endMs": 652812
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "There was an Optics Festival and I wasn't informed? You go now.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 652979,
      "endMs": 656349
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "text": "But... Go!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 656583,
      "endMs": 658085
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "text": "What have we here? \"The Lighter Side of Hippies.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 660621,
      "endMs": 665226
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "text": "They don't care whose toes they step on.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 666160,
      "endMs": 668830
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "text": "This was a lovely idea, Homie.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 676706,
      "endMs": 679442
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "text": "Come here and kiss me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 679609,
      "endMs": 681811
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "text": "Do not be alarmed. Continue swimming naked.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 686617,
      "endMs": 690555
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "text": "Come on. Continue. Come on...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 691356,
      "endMs": 696829
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "text": "All right, Lou, open fire.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 697463,
      "endMs": 698998
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "text": "Wow, the universe is so boring.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 703369,
      "endMs": 707240
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "text": "I know. I'll use this to peer into Springfield's seamy underbelly.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 707474,
      "endMs": 712279
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "text": "It turned out it was his evil twin.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 719521,
      "endMs": 721824
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "text": "Grace, come here. There's a sinister-looking kid I want you to see.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 726462,
      "endMs": 730633
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "text": "I'm never gonna see anything interesting with this stupid piece of junk.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 731635,
      "endMs": 735873
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "text": "That came from Flanders' house.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 741713,
      "endMs": 743782
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "text": "Oh, my God! What have I done? I've killed her!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 753026,
      "endMs": 756363
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "text": "It can't be what it looks like. This is Flanders we're talking about.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 757597,
      "endMs": 761168
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "text": "I'll just watch some TV.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 762136,
      "endMs": 763471
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "text": "Now, what you've been waiting for: Another long raga by Ravi Shankar.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 763704,
      "endMs": 768076
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "text": "Shankar. Shankar.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 768894,
      "endMs": 770396
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "text": "Groovy, man.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 770563,
      "endMs": 772431
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "text": "This can't be what it looks like. There's gotta be some other explanation.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 782376,
      "endMs": 786481
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "text": "I wish there was some other explanation for this, but there isn't!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 786647,
      "endMs": 790519
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "text": "I'm a murderer! I'm a murderer!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 790786,
      "endMs": 792821
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "text": "Then that's not the real Ned Flanders.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 793121,
      "endMs": 795224
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "text": "I'm a mur-diddly-erdiler!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 795758,
      "endMs": 798394
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "text": "If that's not Flanders, he's done his homework.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 798694,
      "endMs": 801398
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "text": "Daddy, where's Mommy? We miss her.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 806303,
      "endMs": 808272
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "text": "Mommy had to go away. She's with God now.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 808439,
      "endMs": 811309
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "text": "Can we go there too?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 812443,
      "endMs": 814112
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "text": "Soon enough.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 814346,
      "endMs": 816114
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "text": "He's gonna kill Rod and Todd too!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 817950,
      "endMs": 820119
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "text": "That's horrible...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 820286,
      "endMs": 821921
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "text": "...in principle.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 822355,
      "endMs": 823589
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "text": "Look, Lisa. I found this change on the bottom of the pool.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 824724,
      "endMs": 828228
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "text": "You can have it. Thanks, Nelson.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 828395,
      "endMs": 831064
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "text": "Somebody took my juice money.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 832399,
      "endMs": 834969
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "text": "Lisa, please join my family for a weekend in the country.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 835169,
      "endMs": 838406
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "text": "There'll be hunting, charades...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 838773,
      "endMs": 840308
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "text": "...and ever so many delightful, romantic misunderstandings.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 840475,
      "endMs": 843479
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "text": "Lisa, Lisa! Watch me!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 843846,
      "endMs": 845714
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "text": "They're only using you for your pool, you know.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 846482,
      "endMs": 848751
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "text": "Shut up, brain. I got friends now. I don't need you anymore.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 848951,
      "endMs": 852188
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "text": "Yeah, I'd love to go to your house.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 853990,
      "endMs": 857428
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "text": "My plan has come to fruition.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 860398,
      "endMs": 862166
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "text": "Soon I'll be queen of summertime.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 862333,
      "endMs": 864369
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "text": "Oh, king. King!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 864636,
      "endMs": 866037
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "text": "Dude, buzz has it an even wussier kid has an even better pool than this.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 872011,
      "endMs": 877317
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "text": "Hello? Hey, I'm stuck in here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 882783,
      "endMs": 886286
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "text": "I gotta think of a way to get out.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 886453,
      "endMs": 888522
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "text": "Well, well, well. Look who 's come crawling back.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 888889,
      "endMs": 892493
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "text": "Listen, Ned Flanders murdered his wife!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 892860,
      "endMs": 895562
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "text": "But why? She's such a fox.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 895762,
      "endMs": 897998
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "text": "I mean, what's on Fox tonight? Something ribald, no doubt.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 898165,
      "endMs": 901468
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "text": "I wish you'd stop spreading bad rumors about people.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 901902,
      "endMs": 904271
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "text": "Remember how you got Grampa tarred and feathered?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 904438,
      "endMs": 906673
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "text": "Sure. That was 20 minutes ago.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 906840,
      "endMs": 908242
    },
    {
      "index": 182,
      "text": "Gonna be in the tub for a while.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 908408,
      "endMs": 909877
    },
    {
      "index": 183,
      "text": "Bart, I'm really sorry I've been ignoring you lately.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 911979,
      "endMs": 914548
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "text": "I got carried away with being popular.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 914715,
      "endMs": 916884
    },
    {
      "index": 185,
      "text": "But now that I'm unpopular again, I want you to know I'm here for you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 917050,
      "endMs": 920787
    },
    {
      "index": 186,
      "text": "You can start making it up to me right now.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 921021,
      "endMs": 923090
    },
    {
      "index": 187,
      "text": "Flanders is leaving the house. I want you to sneak in there...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 923257,
      "endMs": 926160
    },
    {
      "index": 188,
      "text": "...and bring me some evidence! And something sweet.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 926326,
      "endMs": 928695
    },
    {
      "index": 189,
      "text": "Bart, I'm not gonna break into somebody's house.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 928896,
      "endMs": 931398
    },
    {
      "index": 190,
      "text": "All right. You're right. Let's just forget about that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 931598,
      "endMs": 934168
    },
    {
      "index": 191,
      "text": "Here, let me read to you from my play.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 934334,
      "endMs": 937137
    },
    {
      "index": 192,
      "text": "\"Kippers for breakfast, Aunt Helga? Is it Saint Swiven's Day already?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 937371,
      "endMs": 941909
    },
    {
      "index": 193,
      "text": "'Tis, replied Aunt Helga...\" I'm going, I'm going.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 942075,
      "endMs": 946513
    },
    {
      "index": 194,
      "text": "A human head!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 958992,
      "endMs": 960561
    },
    {
      "index": 195,
      "text": "Of course.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 964264,
      "endMs": 965632
    },
    {
      "index": 196,
      "text": "Oh, no. He's back. Flanders is back.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 967234,
      "endMs": 969203
    },
    {
      "index": 197,
      "text": "Lisa, get out of there!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 969369,
      "endMs": 970838
    },
    {
      "index": 198,
      "text": "No, Lisa, don't go upstairs. You'll be trapped!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 972072,
      "endMs": 974808
    },
    {
      "index": 199,
      "text": "An ax! He's got an ax!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 976710,
      "endMs": 978445
    },
    {
      "index": 200,
      "text": "I'll save you, Lisa!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 978612,
      "endMs": 980681
    },
    {
      "index": 201,
      "text": "I'll save you by calling the police.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 982182,
      "endMs": 984184
    },
    {
      "index": 202,
      "text": "Hello, and welcome to the Springfield Police Department Rescue Phone.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 985152,
      "endMs": 989189
    },
    {
      "index": 203,
      "text": "If you know the name of the felony being committed, press one.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 989356,
      "endMs": 992893
    },
    {
      "index": 204,
      "text": "To choose from a list of felonies, press two.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 993160,
      "endMs": 996029
    },
    {
      "index": 205,
      "text": "If you are being murdered or calling from a rotary phone...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 996530,
      "endMs": 999299
    },
    {
      "index": 206,
      "text": "...please stay on the line.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 999466,
      "endMs": 1002135
    },
    {
      "index": 207,
      "text": "You have selected regicide.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1002836,
      "endMs": 1005072
    },
    {
      "index": 208,
      "text": "If you know the name of the king or queen being murdered, press one.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1005239,
      "endMs": 1009610
    },
    {
      "index": 209,
      "text": "I'll save you, cast or no cast!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1016416,
      "endMs": 1018418
    },
    {
      "index": 210,
      "text": "Gotta save Lisa, trash can or no trash can.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1021622,
      "endMs": 1026026
    },
    {
      "index": 211,
      "text": "Oh, no. That sinister-looking kid is coming to kill me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1039273,
      "endMs": 1043243
    },
    {
      "index": 212,
      "text": "Help! Help!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1043377,
      "endMs": 1045512
    },
    {
      "index": 213,
      "text": "Oh, no. Oh, no.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1054621,
      "endMs": 1056523
    },
    {
      "index": 214,
      "text": "It's time to put you away.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1090090,
      "endMs": 1093293
    },
    {
      "index": 215,
      "text": "Put you away for good.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1094595,
      "endMs": 1096563
    },
    {
      "index": 216,
      "text": "No!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1098866,
      "endMs": 1100968
    },
    {
      "index": 217,
      "text": "What the gumdrops is going on here?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1103103,
      "endMs": 1104905
    },
    {
      "index": 218,
      "text": "I came to stop you from murdering Lisa like you murdered your wife!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1105172,
      "endMs": 1108575
    },
    {
      "index": 219,
      "text": "Murdered?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1108742,
      "endMs": 1110544
    },
    {
      "index": 220,
      "text": "Murdered? No, I've just been in the country for a week.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1113914,
      "endMs": 1116583
    },
    {
      "index": 221,
      "text": "But I distinctly heard you say that Maude was with God.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1116750,
      "endMs": 1119486
    },
    {
      "index": 222,
      "text": "That's right. I was at Bible camp. I was learning how to be more judgmental.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1119686,
      "endMs": 1124224
    },
    {
      "index": 223,
      "text": "But I saw the murder, and then I saw you bury the corpse in the backyard!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1124424,
      "endMs": 1127961
    },
    {
      "index": 224,
      "text": "All right, it's true! I am a murderer!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1128128,
      "endMs": 1130898
    },
    {
      "index": 225,
      "text": "I over-watered Maude's favorite ficus plant...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1132032,
      "endMs": 1134201
    },
    {
      "index": 226,
      "text": "...I panicked, and then I buried the remains.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1134368,
      "endMs": 1137004
    },
    {
      "index": 227,
      "text": "I was hoping to replace it before you got home.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1137204,
      "endMs": 1139806
    },
    {
      "index": 228,
      "text": "But I heard a woman scream.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1140240,
      "endMs": 1142142
    },
    {
      "index": 229,
      "text": "Well, now, that I can't explain. We found it, chief.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1143143,
      "endMs": 1146780
    },
    {
      "index": 230,
      "text": "Well, I guess that explains everything.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1148081,
      "endMs": 1150017
    },
    {
      "index": 231,
      "text": "Not everything. There's still the little matter of the whereabouts of your wife.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1150184,
      "endMs": 1155022
    },
    {
      "index": 232,
      "text": "I'm right here. Oh, I see.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1155389,
      "endMs": 1157558
    },
    {
      "index": 233,
      "text": "Then everything is wrapped up in a neat little package.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1157758,
      "endMs": 1160928
    },
    {
      "index": 234,
      "text": "Really, I mean that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1161895,
      "endMs": 1163297
    },
    {
      "index": 235,
      "text": "Sorry if it sounded sarcastic.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1163497,
      "endMs": 1165566
    },
    {
      "index": 236,
      "text": "More friends! More allies!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1169303,
      "endMs": 1171405
    },
    {
      "index": 237,
      "text": "More, I say. Hang those who talk of less.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1171572,
      "endMs": 1174274
    },
    {
      "index": 238,
      "text": "There's a few inches over here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1174441,
      "endMs": 1176610
    },
    {
      "index": 239,
      "text": "My precious pool and its lifestyle accouterments.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1183917,
      "endMs": 1187087
    },
    {
      "index": 240,
      "text": "No!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1187254,
      "endMs": 1188655
    },
    {
      "index": 241,
      "text": "What a drag. I hear you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1189256,
      "endMs": 1191291
    },
    {
      "index": 242,
      "text": "The gentle caress of a summer breeze. www.tvsubtitles.net",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1199199,
      "endMs": 2000
    }
  ],
  "meta": {
    "show": "The Simpsons",
    "season": 6,
    "episode": 1
  }
}
